  "title": "Corrugated sheet metal",
  "purpose": "Generate tileable PBR maps of corrugated sheet metal with a sine or box rib profile, galvanized or painted, with screw rows, rust streaks running down from screws and patches, and dirt in the valleys. Use for sheds, barns, fences, shacks and industrial cladding.",
  "form": "function",
  "asset_role": null,
