  "limits": "Corrugations run down the tile (vertical ribs); rotate the UVs for horizontal cladding. The profile is a height map, so the wavy silhouette at a sheet's edge needs geometry. Streaks always run toward the bottom of the tile. Occlusion is a blurred-height estimate, not ray traced.",
